    "description": "<p>Your target is lifted by a spire of rock. Until they voluntarily slide down, they can only be reached in <strong>melee</strong> by b creatures, and likewise can only use <strong>melee</strong> attacks against <strong>flying</strong> creatures. If there is a ceiling (e.g. in a cavern underground), this spell instead functions as <strong>Terra</strong>, except it can still only target one creature.</p><hr /><p> <strong>@LOSS[10 mp]</strong> </p>",
